     "body": "<p>These results are very helpful. Thanks, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A6bd70f82-b44c-4b7c-8a0a-fd57d9f0ddb1\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:6bd70f82-b44c-4b7c-8a0a-fd57d9f0ddb1\" data-account-id=\"557058:6bd70f82-b44c-4b7c-8a0a-fd57d9f0ddb1\" accountid=\"557058:6bd70f82-b44c-4b7c-8a0a-fd57d9f0ddb1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Jim Coble</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Don't be surprised if you are asked to repeat some of these tests once the tooling is further along.</p>",
